# 📈 Changelog

## v2.3.0 (2026-06-01) - Current
- 🔄 Aligned skill with Reachy Mini SDK / daemon v1.8.0 (was v1.2.6)
- ✨ Replaced openapi_schema.json with live v1.8.0 spec (41 → 85 endpoints)
- ✨ Populated daemon_api.md (full 85-endpoint REST reference) and openapi_usage.md
- ✨ Added daemon_operations.md (app lock, motor modes, media, crash recovery)
- 🐛 Fixed REST paths (/api/move/goto, /api/state/full, /api/motors/set_mode/{mode})
- 🐛 Corrected create_head_pose return type (4×4 ndarray, not a HeadPose object)
- 🐛 Fixed interpolation enum value (ease → ease_in_out)
- 🐛 Rewrote IMU access (mini.imu is now a property returning a dict; quaternion orientation)
- 🐛 Updated motion recording (no Motion class; stop_recording returns a frame list)

## v2.2.0 (2025-01-04)
